OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a village desperately doesn't
OL,4,Awant to be 'a village' any more
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlbrighton in Shropshire has all the
OL,7,Fhallmarks of a typical large rural
OL,8,Fvillage in England.
OL,10,FIt has a popular community centre,
OL,11,Fcricket club, village green and parish
OL,12,Fcouncil. And the land surrounding its
OL,13,Fboundary is almost entirely fields,
OL,14,Fexcept on its western edge where an RAF
OL,15,Fbase has existed since the 1930s.
OL,17,FUntil recently, almost nobody living in
OL,18,FAlbrighton would have considered this
OL,19,F6th Century settlement large enough to
OL,20,Fbe a town. But that has changed.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
