OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a village desperately doesn't
OL,4,Awant to be 'a village' any more
OL,5,
OL,6,FReferring to Albrighton as "a village"
OL,7,Fin front of some of its residents could
OL,8,Fnow result in a telling-off -
OL,9,Fespecially by members of a campaign
OL,10,Fgroup who are ardently fighting against
OL,11,F800 homes being built on adjoining
OL,12,Fgreen belt land.
